# librar

A desktop library management system built to organize, track, and manage books, members, and borrowing activity efficiently.

---

## 🚀 Features

* **Book Management:** Add, update, and remove cataloged books easily.
* **Search & Filter:** Find books quickly by title, author, or category.
* **Borrowing System:** Track borrowed books, due dates, and return status.
* **Member Records:** Keep records of users and their borrowing history.
* **Modern Desktop UI:** Clean Windows Forms interface designed for smooth navigation.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technologies |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Application** | C# / Windows Forms |
| **Framework** | .NET Framework 4.8 |
| **UI Library** | Guna.UI2 |
| **IDE** | Visual Studio |
| **Platform** | Windows |

---

